    "FriendlyName": "Game Net Service",
    "Description": "Persistent GameInstance-scoped service networking: WebSocket (WSS) transport, SPSC GameThread dispatch, exponential-backoff reconnect with jitter, heartbeat keeper, async Request-Response, and GameCore message bus bridge.",
